    <title>v1.22.1</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix(graph): stop selecting on closed producer channels in the fast paths by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/tryoasnafi/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/tryoasnafi&quot;&gt;@tryoasnafi&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5411398572&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/issues/3300&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openfga/openfga/pull/3300/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/pull/3300&quot;&gt;#3300&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix(listobjects): surface condition evaluation errors from the unary pipeline by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/Siddhant-K-code/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/Siddhant-K-code&quot;&gt;@Siddhant-K-code&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5826122942&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/issues/3338&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openfga/openfga/pull/3338/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/pull/3338&quot;&gt;#3338&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;chore: fix errcheck lint issues by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/saad-h1/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/saad-h1&quot;&gt;@saad-h1&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5903246148&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/issues/3349&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openfga/openfga/pull/3349/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/pull/3349&quot;&gt;#3349&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;fix(logging): keep raw req/resp as JSON by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/adriantam/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/adriantam&quot;&gt;@adriantam&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5947180500&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/issues/3354&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openfga/openfga/pull/3354/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/pull/3354&quot;&gt;#3354&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;chore: upgrade Go toolchain to 1.27.3 and golangci-lint to 2.15.0 by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/curfew-marathon/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/curfew-marathon&quot;&gt;@curfew-marathon&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6016009843&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/issues/3359&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openfga/openfga/pull/3359/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/pull/3359&quot;&gt;#3359&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;release: update changelog for release &lt;code&gt;v1.22.1&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/poovamraj/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/poovamraj&quot;&gt;@poovamraj&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;6062796487&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/issues/3367&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openfga/openfga/pull/3367/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/pull/3367&quot;&gt;#3367&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;New Contributors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;user-mention notranslate&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;user&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/users/tryoasnafi/hovercard&quot; data-octo-click=&quot;hovercard-link-click&quot; data-octo-dimensions=&quot;link_type:self&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/tryoasnafi&quot;&gt;@tryoasnafi&lt;/a&gt; made their first contribution in &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5411398572&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/issues/3300&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openfga/openfga/pull/3300/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/pull/3300&quot;&gt;#3300&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/compare/v1.22.0...v1.22.1&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v1.22.0...v1.22.1&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
