    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Fixed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed experimental &lt;code&gt;weighted_graph_check&lt;/code&gt; intermittently returning &lt;code&gt;false&lt;/code&gt; when evaluating relations that cross two or more distinct recursive TTUs which share the same tupleset relation. &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/pull/3244&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/openfga/openfga/pull/3244/hovercard&quot;&gt;#3244&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class=&quot;commit-link&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/openfga/openfga/compare/v1.18.2...v1.18.3&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;v1.18.2...v1.18.3&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
